  "description": "Como o Grok 4.5 reposiciona a SpaceXAI na corrida de modelos? | Onde será o primeiro data center da Meta no Canadá? | Detalhes do novo GPT-Live, modelo da OpenAI para conversas por voz em tempo real",
  "body_html": "<p>Por: Guilherme Saboia e Vinicius Gushiken</p><h3>SpaceXAI lança Grok 4.5 para programação e agentes</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Lançamento.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/spacexai-lanca-modelo-grok-45-focado-em-engenharia-e-codificacao\">SpaceXAI anunciou o Grok 4.5</a> em 8 de julho de 2026, no primeiro grande lançamento da empresa desde a abertura de capital e desde a aquisição da Cursor.</p></li><li><p><strong>Foco.</strong> A Axios descreveu o modelo como <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/spacexai-lanca-modelo-grok-45-focado-em-engenharia-e-codificacao\">voltado principalmente a programação e trabalho agêntico</a>, não como um chatbot de consumo; a Cursor diz que ele foi criado para tarefas complexas e de longa duração.</p></li><li><p><strong>Preço.</strong> O <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/spacexai-lanca-modelo-grok-45-focado-em-engenharia-e-codificacao\">Grok 4.5 custa US$2 por milhão de tokens de </a><em><a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/spacexai-lanca-modelo-grok-45-focado-em-engenharia-e-codificacao\">input</a></em><a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/spacexai-lanca-modelo-grok-45-focado-em-engenharia-e-codificacao\"> e US$6 por milhão de tokens de </a><em><a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/spacexai-lanca-modelo-grok-45-focado-em-engenharia-e-codificacao\">output</a></em>, colocando o lançamento também na disputa de custo por inferência.</p></li><li><p><strong>Casos de uso.</strong> A Cursor citou <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/spacexai-lanca-modelo-grok-45-focado-em-engenharia-e-codificacao\">engenharia de software, ciência de dados, finanças e trabalho jurídico</a> como áreas de uso para o novo modelo.</p></li></ul><div class=\"native-video-embed\" data-component-name=\"VideoPlaceholder\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;mediaUploadId&quot;:&quot;bdc4b062-6e45-4952-b2e0-cea7efb85b5d&quot;,&quot;duration&quot;:null}\"></div><h3>Meta investirá mais de US$9,1 bilhões em data center de IA no Canadá</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Projeto.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-09/meta-investe-us-917-bilhoes-em-data-center-no-canada\">Meta disse que investirá mais de US$9,1 bilhões</a> para construir seu primeiro data center de IA no Canadá, em Sturgeon County, Alberta.</p></li><li><p><strong>Energia.</strong> O projeto será abastecido pelo <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-09/meta-investe-us-917-bilhoes-em-data-center-no-canada\">Greenlight Electricity Center, de 932 megawatts</a>, com início de operação previsto para o segundo semestre de 2030.</p></li><li><p><strong>Infraestrutura.</strong> A Meta disse que o data center usará <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-09/meta-investe-us-917-bilhoes-em-data-center-no-canada\">resfriamento em circuito fechado</a> e que investirá US$42 milhões em infraestrutura local, incluindo estradas e sistemas de abastecimento de água.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"292.5\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:576,&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:520,&quot;bytes&quot;:193679,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Render do data center da Meta em Sturgeon County, Alberta&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Render do data center da Meta em Sturgeon County, Alberta\" title=\"Render do data center da Meta em Sturgeon County, Alberta\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lrow!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F21bb07e6-f18e-4a68-92b1-2bd0ce09ee8a_1024x576.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Render do data center da Meta em Sturgeon County, Alberta. Imagem: Meta</figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><blockquote><p><strong>Abaixo, apenas para assinantes:</strong></p><p><strong>Modelos.</strong> OpenAI lança modelo de voz para conversas mais naturais no ChatGPT.</p><p><strong>Avaliação.</strong> OpenAI revê benchmark de código e aponta falhas nas tarefas.</p><p><strong>Modelos.</strong> Cognition lança novo modelo de software no Devin.</p><p><strong>Agentes.</strong> Rodada de mais de US$100mi de uma empresa de agentes empresariais.</p><p><strong>Hardware.</strong> China planeja liberar compras limitadas de chips Nvidia para grandes empresas de IA.</p><p><strong>Hardware.</strong> As novas rodadas de investimento no setor de semicondutores.</p><p><strong>Segurança.</strong> A operação global da Interpol contra fraudes e engenharia social.</p><p><strong>Defesa.</strong> EUA oferecem licença para Ucrânia fabricar sistema de mísseis.</p><p><strong>Energia.</strong> Petróleo sobe após ataques perto do Estreito de Hormuz.</p></blockquote><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://abacatepay.com\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png\" width=\"4700\" height=\"649\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:649,&quot;width&quot;:4700,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:86036,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;AbacatePay&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;https://abacatepay.com&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"AbacatePay\" title=\"AbacatePay\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MmXm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff44b2401-8353-4151-945f-a4a7650d073d_4700x649.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><h4>Modelos &amp; evals</h4><ul><li><p><strong>OpenAI.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/openai-lanca-modelos-gpt-live-com-arquitetura-de-voz-full-duplex\">OpenAI lançou o GPT-Live</a>, uma nova geração de modelos de voz para conversas mais naturais no ChatGPT. O sistema usa arquitetura full-duplex (comunicação simultânea nos dois sentidos), pode ouvir e falar ao mesmo tempo e repassar raciocínio mais profundo ao GPT-5.5 sem interromper a conversa.</p></li></ul><div id=\"youtube2-EAN5Cj347PY\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;EAN5Cj347PY&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/EAN5Cj347PY?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><ul><li><p><strong>OpenAI.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/openai-aponta-falhas-metodologicas-no-benchmark-swe-bench-pro\">OpenAI disse que cerca de 30% das tarefas do SWE-Bench Pro estão quebradas</a> e retirou sua recomendação anterior de adotá-lo como benchmark de capacidade de programação de fronteira. A auditoria apontou requisitos ocultos, instruções contraditórias e risco de distorção dos resultados.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cognition.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-09/cognition-lanca-modelo-swe-17-com-foco-em-alta-performance-e-custo-reduzido\">Cognition lançou o SWE-1.7</a>, seu modelo mais capaz até então, disponível no Devin web, desktop e CLI. A empresa reportou 42,3% no FrontierCode 1.1 Main, 81,5% no Terminal-Bench 2.1, 77,8% no SWE-Bench Multilingual e serviço via Cerebras a 1.000 TPS (tokens por segundo).</p></li></ul><h4>Agentes &amp; rodadas</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Prime Intellect.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/startup-prime-intellect-capta-us-130-milhoes-e-atinge-valuation-de-us-1-bi\">Prime Intellect levantou US$130 milhões em Série A</a>, em rodada liderada pela Radical Ventures que avaliou a empresa em US$1 bilhão. Nvidia Ventures, Intel Capital, Dell Technologies Capital e Iconiq participaram; a empresa vende um stack para agentes com computação, <em>reinforcement learning</em> (aprendizado por reforço) e avaliação, e chegou a US$100 milhões de receita recorrente anualizada.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"346.328125\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:682,&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:520,&quot;bytes&quot;:202978,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Equipe da Prime Intellect&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Equipe da Prime Intellect\" title=\"Equipe da Prime Intellect\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gW7K!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1e1deff3-c35c-4916-a135-bd6c34ffdd57_1024x682.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Equipe da Prime Intellect. Imagem: Prime Intellect/TechCrunch</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><p><strong>Alta.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/startup-israelense-alta-capta-us-25-milhoes-em-rodada-serie-a\">Alta levantou US$25 milhões em Série A</a>, liderada pela IN Venture, braço de investimentos da Sumitomo Corporation. A startup israelense de agentes de vendas diz ter crescido receita em 800% em menos de um ano e alcançado US$15 milhões de nova receita recorrente anualizada.</p></li></ul><h4>Chips &amp; mercados de capital</h4><ul><li><p><strong>SK Hynix.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/sk-hynix-planeja-ipo-de-us-28-bilhoes-na-nasdaq\">proposta de venda de ações da SK Hynix nos EUA atraiu demanda superior a sete vezes o tamanho da oferta</a>, segundo informação reportada em 9 de julho com base na Reuters. A oferta de ADRs (recibos de ações estrangeiras negociados nos EUA) será feita na Nasdaq. Entre os dias 10 e 13 de julho (período de negociação pré-emissão), negociará sob o <em>ticker</em> SKHYV, trocando para o <em>ticker</em> SKHY daí em diante.</p></li><li><p><strong>Luxshare.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-09/luxshare-levanta-us307-bilhoes-no-maior-ipo-de-hong-kong-em-2026\">Luxshare Precision Industry levantou HK$24,04 bilhões</a>, ou US$3,07 bilhões, no maior IPO (oferta pública inicial) de Hong Kong em 2026. A fornecedora da Apple vem se expandindo para o setor automotivo e para hardware de data centers de IA.</p></li><li><p><strong>Iluvatar CoreX.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-09/fabricante-chinesa-de-gpus-iluvatar-corex-capta-us-902-milhoes\">Iluvatar CoreX levantou cerca de US$902 milhões</a> em uma venda de ações em Hong Kong depois de seu IPO de janeiro. A fabricante de GPUs (unidades de processamento gráfico) sediada em Xangai havia levantado US$473 milhões no IPO, e suas ações tinham subido 257% desde então.</p></li><li><p><strong>Nexchip Semiconductor.</strong> A fabricante chinesa de semicondutores Nexchip Semiconductor <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/nexchip-semiconductor-planeja-levantar-us-890-milhoes-em-hong-kong\">anunciou oficialmente seus planos para uma oferta pública de ações</a> na Bolsa de Valores de Hong Kong. A empresa oferecerá 216,2 milhões de ações a cerca de US$4,12 cada, no topo da faixa indicada ao mercado.</p></li></ul><h4>Compute &amp; chips de IA</h4><ul><li><p><strong>China.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/china-planeja-autorizar-compra-limitada-de-chips-h200-da-nvidia\">China planeja permitir compras limitadas de Nvidia H200</a> por algumas de suas maiores empresas de IA. A medida tenta aliviar uma escassez doméstica de <em>chips</em>, e faz ocorre dentro do cenário de controles de exportação de semicondutores entre EUA e China.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"292.53152279340446\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:580,&quot;width&quot;:1031,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:520,&quot;bytes&quot;:54231,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;GPU NVIDIA H200&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"GPU NVIDIA H200\" title=\"GPU NVIDIA H200\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!31ea!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F186d1081-6a16-469b-a334-0a1567e2a085_1031x580.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">NVIDIA H200, <em>chip</em> de IA dos mais avançados. Imagem: NVIDIA</figcaption></figure></div><ul><li><p><strong>Positron.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/startup-de-chips-de-ia-positron-negocia-aporte-de-us-750-milhoes\">Positron está em conversas para levantar cerca de US$750 milhões</a> em duas fases. A startup de chips de IA sediada em Reno discutiu uma primeira tranche com avaliação de US$3,5 bilhões e uma segunda fase a cerca de US$5 bilhões.</p></li></ul><h4>Segurança &amp; infraestrutura civil</h4><ul><li><p><strong>Interpol.</strong> A <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-09/operacao-global-da-interpol-prende-5811-suspeitos-de-fraude\">Operation First Light 2026 resultou em 5.811 prisões</a> em 97 países e territórios. Autoridades interceptaram US$293 milhões em ativos ilícitos, identificaram mais de 142.000 vítimas e bloquearam 31.014 contas bancárias em uma operação contra golpes de engenharia social e lavagem de dinheiro.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ucrânia.</strong> Trump disse que os <a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-09/trump-autoriza-ucrania-a-produzir-sistemas-de-defesa-patriot\">EUA darão à Ucrânia uma licença para fabricar sistemas Patriot</a>, em anúncio feito durante reunião com Volodymyr Zelenskyy à margem da cúpula da NATO em Ancara. A AP descreveu a medida como um grande impulso para Kyiv em meio a ataques de mísseis russos.</p></li></ul><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg\" width=\"520\" height=\"346.6666666666667\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:3456,&quot;width&quot;:5184,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:520,&quot;bytes&quot;:6043424,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Bateria Patriot em teste de aceitação na Romênia&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Bateria Patriot em teste de aceitação na Romênia\" title=\"Bateria Patriot em teste de aceitação na Romênia\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!JgKP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd2d0b514-2d98-4d7f-a90f-f34202a8b481_5184x3456.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Baterias Patriot em teste de aceitação na Romênia. Imagem: MApN/Wikimedia Commons</figcaption></figure></div><div><hr></div><div class=\"callout-block\" data-callout=\"true\"><h4>Leia também</h4><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-09/block-pagara-us-45-milhoes-para-encerrar-processo-sobre-o-cash-app\">Block pagará US$45 milhões para encerrar investigação multiestadual sobre proteções antifraude do Cash App</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://dailyjournal.news/news/2026-07-08/john-deere-firma-acordo-com-ftc-para-garantir-direito-ao-reparo\">FTC e cinco estados obtêm acordo de direito ao reparo com a John Deere</a></p></li></ul></div><div><hr></div><h3><strong>Recomendações de hoje:</strong></h3><p><strong>Orchestrate the agentic factory of the future:</strong> Este painel, moderado por Praveen Rao (Google Cloud), discute a transição da manufatura tradicional para a “fábrica agêntica” (agentic factory). O foco central é a evolução da automação baseada em regras para sistemas autônomos, onde agentes de IA orquestram fluxos de trabalho complexos e tomam decisões em tempo real, com a participação de executivos da Renault, GE Appliances e Carrier Corporation:</p><div id=\"youtube2-gC-LHHtsfJE\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;gC-LHHtsfJE&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/gC-LHHtsfJE?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><div><hr></div><p><strong>Notion’s Ivan Zhao: The Refounder:</strong> O vídeo apresenta uma entrevista de Ivan Zhao, cofundador e CEO do Notion, conduzida por um parceiro da Sequoia Capital. A conversa explora a trajetória de Zhao como um \"refundador\": alguém que reinicia a empresa estrategicamente para se adaptar a novas eras tecnológicas, especificamente a transição para a IA generativa. O Notion é destacado como um exemplo canônico de como uma empresa SaaS tradicional pode se transformar em uma organização nativa em IA:</p><div id=\"youtube2-ill76IbVuM8\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;ill76IbVuM8&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:&quot;142s&quot;,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ill76IbVuM8?start=142s&amp;rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div>",
